@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
title 02. [Admin] Student Wallet Control

|Admin|
start
:Identify Student & Request Action;
note left: Temporary Lock or Unlock

|Internal Wallet System|
if (Wallet Exists?) then (No)
  |Admin|
  :Receive "Invalid ID" Alert;
  stop
else (Yes)
  |Internal Wallet System|
  if (Pending Transactions Found?) then (Yes)
    |Admin|
    :Decide: Force Lock or Wait;
    note right
      Immediate Lock is used in
      fraud cases to stop "in-flight"
      money movement.
    end note
  endif

  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Execute Lock / Unlock;
  :Record Audit History;
endif

|Admin|
:Notify Relevant Parties;
stop
@enduml